---
description: Accessibility for tool UI
globs: src/components/**,src/styles/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Tap targets >= 48px; body text >= 16px.
- Labels on all inputs; `aria-live` on status messages.
- Skip link, focus-visible styles, semantic landmarks (`main`, `nav`).
- Test at 360px / 390px widths; no horizontal scroll.
